  <item>
    <title>vol28._对话｜人间半杯 X 半水Talk</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65370b9948a62918d037a567</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65370b9948a62918d037a567</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Oct 2023 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人间半杯，这家主打温州江西菜的中式</span><strong><span>“</span></strong><span>小酒馆</span><strong><span>”</span></strong><span>，95后主理人之一桂桂，从江西老家来到杭州，成了一名“杭漂”，在开店之前换过几份工作，然后在2020年12月桂桂合伙决定开一间“小酒馆“，开启餐饮创业的历程，从此在</span><strong><span>人间半杯，快乐满杯</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听</span></p><span></span><p><span>半水Talk</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：小新</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：桂桂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 桂桂的自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 人间半杯的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 关于融合菜的看法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 糖拌西红柿的怀念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 明星网红打卡的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a> 桂桂惊叹某明星的美颜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 人间半杯经历的打假&amp;背叛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 被客人刁难、骂哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> ”不一样“员工的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 人间半杯的餐饮底线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 隐藏的slogan揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 分享爆红的秘籍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 服务生衣服的爱心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> 江西特色菜竟然是螃蟹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 创业干活分享开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a> 为什么不做店庆</span></p><span></span><p><span>人间半杯「密照」（均来自桂桂朋友圈）：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhC41xi1pLDoJRlLFFJKw_SXPzbN.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuiMAQ6YYlzO-zG1ogoMCUlHiqlJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjEbOzAwqekhdCRMtZFDCIetBMGv.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv9RBt8geT6vXXaaU9yBo3BDNBB4.png"></figure><span></span><p></p>]]></description>
